<title>THAILAND: Securities One Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Securities One Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unreviewed financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.93     vs	     2.02</p>
<p>    Net			109.95     vs	   181.77</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.32     vs	     8.07</p>
<p>    Net			626.23     vs	   726.60</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
